
@startuml

!include styles.puml

title Smart Community Services Platform - Software Architecture
header ICT602 - Software Engineering | Group 1 | MEL_S2_2026-1

top to bottom direction

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Presentation Layer" {
  component "ConsoleUI" as UI
}

package "Application Layer" {
  component "ServiceRequestService" as SRS
}

package "Domain Layer" {
  component "ServiceRequest" as SR
  component "Location" as LOC
  component "Feedback" as FB
  component "MaintenanceTeam" as MT
  component "User and Role Classes" as USERS
  component "RequestStatus / RequestPriority" as ENUMS
}

package "Persistence Layer" {
  interface "ServiceRequestRepository" as REPO
  component "InMemoryServiceRequestRepository" as MEM
}

UI --> SRS : invokes operations

SRS --> SR : manages
SRS --> LOC : validates location
SRS --> FB : records feedback
SRS --> MT : assigns team
SRS --> USERS : checks roles
SRS --> ENUMS : uses statuses

SRS --> REPO : saves / retrieves
MEM ..|> REPO : implements

note right of UI
  Command-line interface
  for the Java prototype
end note

note right of MEM
  In-memory storage using
  Java collections
end note

caption Task 2 - Layered Architecture for Service Request Management

@enduml
